  Description: 'The open water off St Peters'' east wall, and where the game begins - out with the captain at six in the morning, a rod stowed on her deck and the island a mile to the west. Sail west and you are home; the sea the other way is the mid-bay''s, and that is later. NAME OWED: the owner names the water scenes in PEI-variant style (world-map-plan 7 Q4); the id is stable whatever he picks.'
